heart\nIf this is a daydream, don't wake me, don't start\n\n[Bridge - playful, lighthearted, intimate yet bouncy]\nI don't recognize the girl in the glass\nShe hums your melody and lets the hours pass\nShe used to be careful, used to be slow\nNow she's dancing wherever you go\n\n[Final Chorus - explosive joy, big harmonies, handclaps]\nIs it real, is it real, this light in my chest?\nSweet as the summer, warm as the west\nSeven-oh-nine on the dial of my heart\nIf this is a daydream, don't wake me, don't start\nDon't wake me, don't wake me — I'm yours, every part\n\n[Outro - fade out with whistling, guitar, laughter]\nGolden radio, keep playing along\nHoney, if it's magic, I've been singing it right\n（laughing）… It is real!"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "歌词！", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [400, 200], "pos": [-1285.1007080078125, -195.4317626953125], "id": 171, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 14}, {"outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [318], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "STRING"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["female vocal, sunny indie pop with upbeat folk-electronica elements in G major, cheerful and sweet atmosphere, radiant and energetic summer morning vibe, instruments: lively acoustic guitar strumming, bright electric piano/bell-like tones, bouncy synth pads, upbeat percussion with shaker, tambourine, rim clicks, playful bass line, occasional whistle, light laughter samples, bright and crisp timbre with warm airy feel, mid-fast tempo at 95 BPM, high-fidelity production with wide soundstage and clean reverb, clear sweet female vocal with smile-filled and bouncy delivery"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "value"}], "fla